OL,3,ASri Lankan court to deliver verdict on
OL,4,Adeadly Easter bombings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sri Lankan court is set to rule on 24
OL,7,Fpeople accused of plotting the 2019
OL,8,FEaster Sunday bomb attacks that killed
OL,9,F270 people and injured more than 500.
OL,11,FThe case against Naufer Moulavi, named
OL,12,Fas the main mastermind of the attacks,
OL,13,Fand 23 others has dragged on for years.
OL,15,FThe co-ordinated suicide attacks on
OL,16,Fmultiple locations including several
OL,17,Fchurches holding Easter mass and three
OL,18,Fluxury hotels were the deadliest Sri
OL,19,FLanka had seen since the end of its
OL,20,Fcivil war in 2009.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
